{"anon_id": "P3-b3e00c23", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "元卒立为嗣证实，立嗣月档时点未载无核"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b4758e02", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "次日财方入手证实，但实在戊申日非亥日、先耗量减未核"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b54c744c", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 2, "pass": false, "gap_note": "本府不准复职与所断相反，后巳年补知府仅远段半合；酉月坐标大偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b604459c", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 0, "total": 0, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断弟病可愈，实则三日内果死，全反"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b6165eb7", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "病重难愈合于卒，但主坐标未日与卯日偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b7368a64", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "邵氏影业王国巨擘证实，运档时点仅约合"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b74f906c", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "终局驳翻活罪合于转轻，然初议绞罪与所断非重罪反、酉月未核"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b7668739", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "妻病及冬而愈证实，但所断旬内子日与及冬实应尺度大偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b77dbc4f", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "京剧宗师、院长文联职、非以伶官终身俱证实，运档时点仅约合"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b8a2f866", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 0, "total": 0, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断考秩中下，实则次年孟夏得上上卷，全反"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b942f89e", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "官至行政院长、上海市长、央行总裁证实财金行政高位，运档时点仅约合"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bb066f3f", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "八月夥计盗尽分文不复证实开铺亏耗，然耗象实在六八月非辰月"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bb3c91af", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "子痘不治证实，但主坐标寅日与戊申日偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bb918474", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 1, "total": 1, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断买卖小利，实则改买棉花果亏折，方向反；结局无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bbb76284", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "历任通州、擢大司农大司马证实功名可成，年档时点未载无核"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bbd3bc81", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "讼果应不成证实；预测未给具体应期，无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bc32fea5", "direction": 1, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "破损一断证实，然实物为玉绦环非金属有足器物，对象断错位"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bc41ec1c", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 0, "total": 3, "pass": false, "gap_note": "虽危不死及冬而愈证实向愈，但所断三日内亥日与及冬实应尺度大偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-beb15dc7", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 1, "total": 1, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断坟地不宜，实则葬后三年二子皆发科甲，方向反；未月坐标无核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bed8185e", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bfe491a4", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bff1a9b3", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 0, "total": 0, "pass": false, "gap_note": "断官运有进，实则巳年被论宦囊消索，全反"}
{"anon_id": "P3-c03e0002", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "结局『后果然』总承讼解之断，然分项与子日未分载无核"}
